-Gather, then write. Gather with (bounded) reads:
-
-1. `ls -d */` in the repo root → identify top-level modules.
-2. Read `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `README*`, `pyproject.toml`, `Makefile`, `docker/` configs, `.github/workflows/*.yml` — skim, do not dump into memory verbatim.
